      "content": "SP 90 NW      CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST. LEONARDS      CHAPEL LANE,                                                (east side)                                                St Leonards 2/58                                                Church of St Leonard 22.12.58 -                                              II* Parish church, originally a chapel of ease to Aston Clinton, probably C15, restored C17 and 1845.  Nave and Chancel in one.  Plastered walls, tiled roof.  Wooden bell turret with small tiled pyramid spire at  west end.  C19, S. porch.  C15 windows.  Interior: C16  arch braced roof trusses in nave.  Early C18 wall tablets. RCHM I p 20 MON 2 Listing NGR: SP9099807065"
    }
